                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "532f5bce-78b8-30a0-ad81-a0df234403be",
                        "entry_id": "842d03b3-4ee8-38e1-8ebd-ae277f944c72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To undo the process of thinking."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5fe61d9-f634-4bfd-a8a0-11090151e1b9",
                                "sense_id": "532f5bce-78b8-30a0-ad81-a0df234403be",
                                "text": "They at least had the immense and mighty imagination of which I speak; they could unthink the past. They could uncreate the Fall. With a reverence which moderns might think impudence, they could uncreate the Creation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09b61a96-302d-4182-9472-3c8d82a34928",
                                "sense_id": "532f5bce-78b8-30a0-ad81-a0df234403be",
                                "text": "But to do so consistently would require a fairly radical revision of the concept. We should have to unthink as far back as Aristotle […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6cd0382-986c-438d-9d94-a4088cc9ec56",
                                "sense_id": "532f5bce-78b8-30a0-ad81-a0df234403be",
                                "text": "In An Experiment with an Air-Pump, characters repeatedly assert that \"once you've thought something, you can't unthink it, can you?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f697ef8-3f15-46b8-8437-f09dcdbd1c28",
                                "sense_id": "532f5bce-78b8-30a0-ad81-a0df234403be",
                                "text": "\"You must learn to edit your thoughts,\" she said. \"Unthink them...\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
